      "created_at": "2016-05-10T05:25:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Trial of Baron Blade (one shot) looks like an issue which deals with his origins via flashback - maybe including 13-year old Ivan watching from afar as a factory collapsed on his father and his rise to power after. And may be an issue which tackles philosophical discussions - cyclical nature of revenge of son killing father killing son?</p>\n<p>And maybe Consider The Price of Victory in its full glory??</p>",
